---
// Sveltia CMS mount, served at /admin/.
//
// Why a route and not a static public/admin/index.html: Astro's dev and preview
// servers don't serve directory indexes, so /admin/ 404s for a static file
// (only /admin/index.html resolves). A route makes /admin/ work uniformly in
// dev, preview, and production.
//
// The bundle auto-loads ./config.yml (served from public/admin/config.yml,
// emitted from src/content.config.ts by scripts/emit-sveltia-config.ts).
// `is:inline` keeps Astro from bundling the external script; the Sveltia docs
// warn against type="module" and CSS links, so neither is used.
//
// Local editing: open this page in a Chromium browser (Chrome/Edge/Brave),
// click "Work with Local Repository", and pick the repo root. No proxy or
// GitHub repo needed — Sveltia reads/writes the working tree directly.
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex" />
    <title>Roastbook · Admin</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <script is:inline src="https://unpkg.com/@sveltia/cms/dist/sveltia-cms.js"></script>
  </body>
</html>
